        "en": "**The app cannot check this part.** For the writing, please use pen and paper. For the speaking, say it out loud and, if you can, practise with a native speaker or a teacher who can correct you.\n\n**Write (60–80 words).** Explain in writing how to get from the airport to the centre of your city by public transport.\n\n**Speak (about 1 minute).** Ask aloud at a ticket office: which line, where to change, how much, how long."
